// arguments stripped) followed by the literal constructor arguments, for example
// "NormalRand(0, 1)". Golden and reference CSV files are keyed by that id, so do not
// reformat existing lines; append new ones instead.
//
// RL_CONT  continuous univariate (including circular)
// RL_CONT_V2  continuous univariate not present in the v1.1 golden-data baseline
// RL_CONT_NO_STATS  continuous univariate excluded from sampling tests for a documented numerical reason
// RL_CONT_V2_NO_STATS  combines the preceding two markers
// RL_DISC  discrete univariate
// RL_SING  singular univariate
// RL_BIVC  continuous bivariate
// RL_BIVD  discrete bivariate

